        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"ca21c5bb-7d5b-4210-b36d-b8c4394bd911\",\"review_text\":\"I love spotify! Even the free version is the shiznik! They curate playlists based off what your listening patterns are, intro to new artists, different genres, I've even started listening to foreign rap.. 1 word... FIRE🔥🔥🔥\"},{\"review_id\":\"24ee043a-16c5-4f68-ac2e-fa2e80f78d6f\",\"review_text\":\"Shodan y court\"},{\"review_id\":\"96b02d63-343f-4aba-8eff-7983f39d866c\",\"review_text\":\"Gandaa apk hai ye faltu\"},{\"review_id\":\"7d9cd4ae-48c3-40b2-8b68-e3f55f5a43c9\",\"review_text\":\"After a recent update, the app has started lagging when you select a song it doesn't play and so many other things. All this is happening in a premium version.\"},{\"review_id\":\"38b2efd4-82b0-453d-b614-2d5025c81c88\",\"review_text\":\"Hi Spotify you boost youer sonud please Thank Using for nice app no ad\"},{\"review_id\":\"365d1919-8fe9-40ce-ac7c-ad90d1217f41\",\"review_text\":\"I love the music on it simple but without wifi is jus 😔\"},{\"review_id\":\"da5452e4-fe4b-4b11-b800-8105bc87ca02\",\"review_text\":\"Amazing, wow!!! Love how you guys allow music to be in the background, I have propoer music libraries here and can also download music... Even watching the lyrics as I sing along.. Its a real treasure!\"},{\"review_id\":\"7f0e510a-b329-42b2-9df1-f83e22aaabb2\",\"review_text\":\"Only download on xbox or Playstation unless you plan on having premium, Spotify sucks, go with youtube or something like that.\"},{\"review_id\":\"deea4810-5e0c-48d3-b2f4-e02493bcaaf8\",\"review_text\":\"This app very ads\"},{\"review_id\":\"a4069420-e887-4e34-88e8-b14fc3458182\",\"review_text\":\"Nogal goed\"}]}"
